│                                                                             │
│  Task: MISSION: Systematically cross-check the generated Lambda code        │
│  (output/lambdas/)                                                          │
│  against the SAM template (output/template.yaml) and the architecture       │
│  blueprint                                                                  │
│  (storage/blueprint.json). Fix any mismatches found, then re-validate.      │
